    'medium' => ['What I loved most about {company_name} was how human the whole process felt. They didn\'t just hand us a technical spec sheet; they sat down with our team, had coffee, and really dug into our daily frustrations. The software they built actually solves our real-world problems, not just the technical ones. It’s rare to find developers with this much empathy.',
