        'I can\'t say enough good things about {company_name}. We came to them with a half-baked idea for an internal tool, and they helped us flesh it out into a fully realized application. They pushed back when we asked for things that didn\'t make sense, which I really respect. They care more about the product\'s success than just billing hours.',
