        'Fast, reliable, and friendly. {company_name} is the best web development partner we\'ve found.'],
    'medium' => ['What I loved most about {company_name} was how human the whole process felt. They didn\'t just hand us a technical spec sheet; they sat down with our team, had coffee, and really dug into our daily frustrations. The website they built actually solves our real-world problems.',
        'We\'ve worked with dev agencies before who treat you like a ticket number. {company_name} is the complete opposite. Our project manager knew everyone on our team by name and checked in constantly. Oh, and the custom website they built is incredibly smooth and bug-free.',
        'The transition to our new website was something I was dreading, but {company_name} held our hands through the entire process. They sent a couple of their guys over to do in-person training with our staff. The site is fast, clean, and exactly what we asked for.',
        'I can\'t say enough good things about {company_name}. We came to them with a half-baked idea for our corporate site, and they helped us flesh it out into a fully realized digital presence. They pushed back when we asked for things that didn\'t make sense, which I really respect.',
        'If you want a web team that actually communicates, hire {company_name}. We had a weekly video call where they walked us through what they built, in plain English. When we hit a roadblock with a third-party plugin, they didn\'t point fingers; they just found a workaround.',
        'The bespoke eCommerce site {company_name} developed for us has completely changed our sales floor. Our reps used to hate our old system, but this new one is so intuitive. The devs at {company_name} shadowed our team for a day before designing the interface.',
        'Working with {company_name} felt like working with friends who just happen to be incredibly talented coders. They were patient with our non-technical stakeholders and always made sure everyone was on the same page. The responsive site they delivered is sleek and fast.',
        'We hired {company_name} to rescue a web project that another agency botched. They were incredibly gracious and didn\'t badmouth the previous devs, just got straight to work fixing the mess. They turned a nightmare situation into a massive success story.',
        'It’s hard to find developers who understand business, not just code. {company_name} gets it. They asked questions about our revenue model and user acquisition strategy to ensure the website supported our actual business goals. The final product is strategically brilliant.',
        'Our project with {company_name} was a joy from start to finish. We had a dedicated Slack channel with their team, and they were always quick to reply with a joke or a helpful update. The quality of the code is top-notch, but their enthusiasm is what I\'ll remember most.',
        'I was blown away by the level of care {company_name} put into our project. When a crucial deadline was approaching, a couple of their developers stayed up late with us to ensure a smooth launch. That kind of dedication is hard to find in web development.',
        'The website {company_name} built is brilliant, but their onboarding process is what really impressed me. They created these simple, easy-to-follow video tutorials specifically for our staff, walking through the CMS. It made the adoption process entirely painless.',
        'We approached {company_name} because we needed a custom booking platform. They challenged our assumptions and suggested a much leaner, more cost-effective approach. Their honesty saved us thousands of dollars. The site works perfectly and their integrity is unmatched.',
        'What sets {company_name} apart is their incredible attention to the user experience. They didn\'t just build a functional site; they built an experience that feels good to use. They spent hours tweaking minor animations and button placements just because \'it felt better.\'',
        'I’m not a tech person, and the idea of managing a web build was terrifying. {company_name} made it so easy. My project manager was an absolute angel, translating my messy thoughts into actionable tasks. The end result is a beautifully functioning website.',
        '{company_name} has a truly special team. We had some massive scope changes mid-project, which usually causes a ton of friction. Instead, they calmly reassessed the timeline and pivoted without a single complaint. Their flexibility made a stressful situation manageable.',
        'The mobile-responsive site {company_name} developed for our business has been a massive hit. Beyond the great code, I really appreciated how they treated our team. They remembered birthdays, sent us a nice gift basket when we launched, and always asked how our families were doing.',
        'We needed a highly secure data portal on our site, and {company_name} delivered flawlessly. But what I loved most was their transparency. If there was a bug, they owned up to it immediately and fixed it. That kind of honesty builds real trust.',
        'Our experience with {company_name} was phenomenal. They built a custom intranet portal for our employees. What impressed me most was that they insisted on testing it with a small group of our least tech-savvy employees first to make sure it was truly idiot-proof.',
        'If you want a sterile, corporate transaction, go somewhere else. {company_name} brings personality and passion to their work. We had some heated (but fun) debates about feature prioritization, and I always felt like they were fighting for the best possible product.',
        'The developers at {company_name} are absolute wizards, but they don\'t act like it. They are humble, patient, and always willing to explain the \'why\' behind their technical decisions. They built an amazing site for us, but they also educated our team along the way.',
        '{company_name} really goes the extra mile. When we launched our new site, their lead developer actually came to our office to be on standby for any day-one glitches. Nothing major went wrong, but having him there just in case was incredibly reassuring.',
        'We hired {company_name} to build a bespoke directory site. They took the time to understand the extreme stress our content managers are under and designed a one-click workflow that cut admin time in half. It’s rare to find developers who care so deeply.',
        'Our startup was running out of runway and we needed our site built fast. {company_name} didn\'t just act as an outsourced dev shop; they acted like co-founders. They worked crazy hours alongside us and helped us cut unnecessary features to hit our launch date.',
        'I cannot recommend {company_name} highly enough. They built a robust web portal for us, but the best part was their communication. Every Friday afternoon, we got a plain-English email summarizing what was done. It made me look great to my boss, and the site is bulletproof.',
        'The team at {company_name} brought our vision to life in a way we couldn\'t have imagined. They took our basic wireframes and turned them into a gorgeous, highly functional web app. They were always eager to hear our feedback and never got defensive about changes.',
        'When you hire {company_name}, you aren\'t just getting developers; you\'re getting strategic partners. They helped us rethink our entire site architecture before they even started coding, saving us from a massive headache down the road. The site is fast and scalable.',
        'We had a tight budget for our custom site, and {company_name} respected it completely. They didn\'t try to upsell us on flashy features we didn\'t need. Instead, they focused on building a solid, reliable core product. Their integrity made the process refreshing.',
        'The custom eCommerce platform {company_name} built for us is incredible, but their post-launch support is what really shines. Whenever we have a question, we get a response from a real person who actually worked on our project, not an automated ticketing system.',
        'Building a custom website is usually a stressful nightmare, but {company_name} made it actually fun. Their team is hilarious, warm, and insanely talented. We looked forward to our weekly check-ins just to chat with them. The site is flawless, and we honestly miss working with them!'],
    'long' => [
    "When we realized off-the-shelf templates weren't cutting it for our unique business, we were incredibly anxious about commissioning a custom web build. It felt like a massive risk. Then we met the team at {company_name}. From the very first consultation, they put us at ease. They didn't overwhelm us with technical jargon or try to sell us the most expensive package. Instead, they spent time watching how our users actually interacted with our content. When they presented their proposal, it was clear they had listened perfectly. The development phase was a breeze; they kept us updated with friendly check-ins and were incredibly patient when we changed our minds. The final website has completely revolutionized our digital presence. Our staff loves the backend CMS because it was designed specifically for them. {company_name} didn't just write code; they took the time to understand our people, and that human touch made all the difference.",
    "I cannot overstate how wonderful our experience with {company_name} has been. We are a mid-sized nonprofit, and every dollar counts. We needed a custom donation portal, and we were terrified of cost overruns. {company_name} assigned us a project manager who became an honorary member of our team. He was compassionate, incredibly organized, and always available. The development team was just as amazing. When they realized a feature would take significantly more hours than budgeted, they paused work and helped us brainstorm a cheaper alternative that achieved the exact same goal. They protected our budget like it was their own. The final site launched flawlessly, and our donor retention has increased because the system makes giving so easy. {company_name} provided enterprise-level development with the warmth and care of a local mom-and-pop shop.",
    "Our startup was in a tight spot. We had hired a cheap offshore dev team to build our site, and they left us with a tangled mess of broken code and zero communication. We brought {company_name} in on a Hail Mary, and they were absolute lifesavers. They didn't judge us for the mess. They just calmly assessed the situation, told us exactly what could be salvaged, and then they got to work. What blew me away was their transparency. Every single day, we got a short video update from the lead developer showing exactly what he was working on. It felt like they were sitting right next to us. They worked late nights and weekends to hit our launch date, all while maintaining a positive attitude. The site they delivered is robust, fast, and beautiful. {company_name} saved our company with empathy and professionalism.",
    "The thought of migrating our massive, outdated corporate site to a modern platform was terrifying. Our staff is older, not particularly tech-savvy, and deeply resistant to change. We chose {company_name} because they emphasized user adoption during their pitch, and they absolutely delivered. Before writing any code, they held focus groups with our grumpiest employees to hear their concerns. They designed the new backend interface to look familiar enough that it wouldn't cause panic, but modern enough to dramatically improve speed. During the rollout, {company_name} sent their developers to sit with our staff and gently guide them through the new workflows. The patience they showed was saint-like. Because of their incredibly empathetic approach, what we thought would be a month of operational chaos turned into a seamless transition. The site is brilliant, but {company_name}'s humanity is their true selling point.",
    "If you are looking for a web agency that feels like a true partner rather than a vendor, {company_name} is the only choice. We engaged them to build a highly complex web portal. Throughout the nine-month build, the team at {company_name} became our closest confidants. We had a shared Slack channel that was half intense design debates and half sharing pictures of our pets. They are incredibly brilliant designers and engineers, but they leave their egos at the door. When one of our stakeholders had a meltdown over a misunderstood feature, the {company_name} team handled it with such grace and de-escalated the situation perfectly. The platform they built is a technical marvel. But honestly, I'm writing this review because I actually miss our daily standups with them. They are good, decent, hardworking people who happen to be world-class web developers.",
    "We had a massive vision for a new community platform, and {company_name} brought it to life beautifully. But what I want to highlight is their incredible communication. In the past, dealing with web agencies meant throwing requirements over a wall and hoping for the best. With {company_name}, the collaboration was constant and organic. We used to have brainstorming sessions where their designers would sketch out ideas on a digital whiteboard with us in real-time. They challenged our ideas politely when they knew a better technical approach, which I deeply appreciated. The site they built has increased our user engagement by 40%, and our moderators actually requested to meet the devs to thank them personally because the backend is so much easier on their eyes. {company_name} managed to bridge the gap between complex engineering and human usability perfectly.",
    "Hiring {company_name} was the turning point for our business. We were drowning in a sea of disconnected plugins and messy WordPress pages. We needed a clean, centralized site, but we didn't even really know how to articulate what we wanted. The consultants at {company_name} were like therapists for our business. They patiently mapped out all our chaotic processes, helped us identify the bottlenecks, and designed a custom web solution that unified everything. The development process felt completely stress-free because we trusted them implicitly. They were always honest about timelinesif something was going to take longer, they told us immediately with a clear explanation, rather than hiding it until the deadline. The platform they delivered is fast, reliable, and perfectly tailored to our quirks. Our stress levels have plummeted because the site just works.",
    "The team at {company_name} are magicians. We came to them with an impossibly tight deadline to build a custom landing page ecosystem for a massive upcoming marketing campaign. Other agencies laughed us out of the room, but {company_name} looked at the requirements, gave us a realistic assessment, and promised to bust their tails to get it ready. And boy, did they. I know they worked some late nights, but you would never know it from their attitude on our morning callsthey were always cheerful, sharp, and focused. The site launched on time and handled a massive spike in traffic flawlessly. But the human touch didn't stop at launch. On the day of the campaign, their lead architect voluntarily stayed on a live video feed with our team for 12 hours straight, just in case anything went wrong. Nothing did, but having him there brought our stress levels way down.",
    "We are a small, family-owned healthcare clinic, and compliance is a terrifying beast for us. We needed a secure patient portal built into our site, but we couldn't afford a massive enterprise agency. {company_name} treated us with the utmost respect and care. They assigned a developer who patiently walked us through every security measure they were implementing so we could sleep at night. They didn't talk down to us when we asked basic questions. In fact, they created a custom glossary of terms for us so we could follow along with their progress reports. The site they built is clean, beautiful, and our patients constantly compliment how easy it is to use. When we had a minor bug a few weeks after launch, I texted our project manager on a Saturday morning expecting a reply on Monday. He fixed it within an hour. That level of genuine care is why I recommend {company_name}.",
    "The custom e-learning platform that {company_name} developed for us is a masterpiece, but the journey to get there was even better. Web development can be incredibly dry, but {company_name} made it vibrant and exciting. They brought real creative energy to the project, suggesting interactive features we hadn't thought of that ended up being the most popular part of the site. They were fiercely protective of accessibility, insisting that the platform be fully usable for visually impaired students, which wasn't even in our original spec. They cared about our end-users as much as we did. Throughout the year-long build, we celebrated milestones together, shared frustrations, and truly functioned as one unified team. The site is currently serving thousands of students without a single crash. {company_name} doesn't just build websites; they build relationships and products with a soul.",
    "I've been in digital marketing for 20 years, and I've managed dozens of outsourced web projects. {company_name} is the best I've ever worked with, period. The technical prowess of their engineers is top-tier, but what makes them exceptional is their communication and humility. Usually, when you hire smart developers, you get a lot of arrogance. Not with {company_name}. They are eager to collaborate, quick to admit when they don't know something, and always respectful of our internal team's opinions. We hired them to rebuild a critical, high-traffic media site. They handled the pressure with remarkable calm, delivering an architecture that has reduced our hosting costs and dramatically improved performance. During the cutover weekend, their entire team was online with us, keeping the mood light while executing a flawless migration. They are the epitome of professionalism with a human touch.",
    "We wanted to build a community-driven web app, and we needed a development team that understood community. {company_name} was the perfect fit. From day one, they were obsessed with the user journey. They didn't just want to know what the buttons should do; they wanted to know how the user should feel when they clicked them. Their UX designer spent hours interviewing our potential users to ensure the interface was welcoming. The development team then executed that vision perfectly. When we hit a snag with our email notification strategy, their product manager sat down with us and helped us rewrite our copy to be more engaging, which isn't even their job! They just wanted the site to succeed. Since launch, the site has gained incredible traction, and our users constantly praise the smooth experience. {company_name} invested their hearts into this project.",
    "Our experience with {company_name} was a masterclass in how web development should be done. We are a large corporation with a lot of bureaucracy, which usually slows projects to a crawl. The team at {company_name} navigated our internal politics with incredible tact and charm. They knew exactly when to push back on scope creep and when to be flexible to keep stakeholders happy. We were building a massive internal employee portal, and they managed to unite three warring departments by designing a system that compromised perfectly. The site itself is a work of artthe code is incredibly clean, well-documented, and fully tested. But their greatest achievement was making our HR team feel heard and respected throughout the build. They held weekly 'show and tell' sessions that became the highlight of our week. {company_name} handles enterprise projects without losing the personal touch.",
    "We are a non-technical founding team, and we were terrified of being taken advantage of by a dev agency. {company_name} was recommended by a friend, and they were a breath of fresh air. They operate with radical transparency. They gave us access to their Jira boards, invited us to their daily standups, and explained their billing down to the minute. When they realized they could use an open-source library to save us $10,000 on a specific feature, they did it immediately, rather than padding their own pockets. The SaaS platform they built for us is robust and scalable, but it's their integrity that I am most impressed by. They treated our startup's meager funds with incredible respect. Our project manager was like a den mother to us, constantly reassuring us during stressful moments. {company_name} is an agency with a real conscience, and I trust them implicitly.",
    "The bespoke data visualization site that {company_name} built for our research firm is nothing short of spectacular. We deal with massive, complex datasets, and our analysts were losing their minds trying to use standard tools. {company_name} came in, sat with our data scientists, and really dug into the math. They didn't just build a pretty interface; they built a powerful web engine that can process millions of rows in seconds. But what I loved most was their enthusiasm. Their developers geeked out over our data just as much as we did. They were constantly coming up with cool new ways to visualize the information on the frontend that we hadn't even thought of. It felt less like a client-vendor relationship and more like an academic collaboration. The site has revolutionized how we present findings to clients. {company_name} is a team of brilliant, passionate nerds, and we love them.",
    "I'll never forget the kickoff meeting we had with {company_name}. We had brought a massive, intimidating list of requirements for a custom marketplace site. Instead of flinching, their lead developer smiled and said, 'This is going to be fun.' And it was! They broke the massive project down into manageable, bite-sized pieces so we never felt overwhelmed. Their agile process is the best I've seen; every two weeks, they delivered a working piece of the site that we could actually click through. This kept our entire company excited and engaged in the project. Whenever we found a bug during testing, they didn't get defensive; they thanked us for finding it and fixed it immediately. The final marketplace fits our business model like a glove, and our vendor adoption rate was incredible. {company_name} brings joy and a deeply human touch to web development.",
    "We approached {company_name} with a desperate plea. Our core eCommerce site, built years ago, was crashing during traffic spikes, and the original developer was long gone. We were losing money every time it went down. {company_name} treated our crisis with the urgency it deserved, but they brought a calming presence that we desperately needed. They quickly stabilized the old site to stop the bleeding, and then worked with us to architect a modern, cloud-based replacement. The journey took months, and their communication was flawless the entire time. They assigned a dedicated liaison who translated the technical work into business impacts we could understand. When the new site finally launched, it was a non-eventin the best possible way. No crashes, no lost sales, just a beautiful, fast new interface. {company_name} literally saved our online business.",
    "Working with {company_name} to build our custom web application was a remarkably smooth experience, entirely due to their people-first approach. We wanted a site that helped seniors manage their local community events, so user experience was absolutely critical. {company_name} didn't just assume they knew what seniors wanted. They brought in a panel of elderly testers and spent days watching them interact with prototypes, making tiny adjustments to font sizes, contrast, and button placements. The developers showed incredible empathy, listening to the testers' frustrations without ever making them feel inadequate. The final site is a triumph. It's beautiful, incredibly simple to use, and completely accessible. Our user reviews constantly mention how easy the site is to navigate. {company_name} builds websites with a level of compassion that is incredibly rare.",
    "We are a high-growth marketing agency, and we needed a custom client portal to aggregate reporting from a dozen platforms. We chose {company_name} because they didn't just nod at our requirements; they aggressively questioned them to make sure we were building the right thing. I loved that they pushed back. It showed they cared about the outcome, not just the paycheck. The development phase was a masterclass in project management. Their team was always two steps ahead, anticipating API rate limits before they became issues. But beyond their technical brilliance, they are just great people. Our weekly syncs were full of laughter and genuine connection. When the project wrapped, we actually threw a virtual pizza party with their dev team because we were going to miss working with them. The portal is flawless, and {company_name} has earned a customer for life.",
    "If I had to describe {company_name} in one word, it would be 'reliable'. But that doesn't capture the warmth they bring to their work. We hired them to build a highly secure document exchange portal for our law firm. Lawyers are notoriously difficult clientswe are demanding, impatient, and deeply concerned with confidentiality. {company_name} handled us perfectly. They were unflappable in the face of our aggressive deadlines and incredibly patient when explaining their encryption protocols to our senior partners. They assigned a project manager who felt like an extension of our own firm, always anticipating our needs and communicating proactively. The site they delivered is a fortress, yet it's incredibly user-friendly. It has drastically reduced our administrative overhead. {company_name} proved that you don't have to sacrifice a pleasant working relationship to get enterprise-grade web security.",
    "The custom B2B ordering portal that {company_name} built for our wholesale business is fantastic, but the real story is how they handled the rollout. Implementing a new ordering system across hundreds of clients is a logistical nightmare. {company_name} didn't just hand us the site and wish us luck. They created a comprehensive, empathetic rollout plan. They helped us draft the communication emails, created quick-reference video guides for our clients, and had a dedicated support queue set up for the first week of go-live. When one of our older clients struggled with the new interface, the lead developer from {company_name} actually jumped on a screen share and spent an hour walking him through it until he felt confident. You simply cannot buy that level of care from a typical agency. The site works perfectly, but the people at {company_name} are what make them truly exceptional.",
    "We had a vision for a disruptive real estate platform, and {company_name} turned it into reality faster and better than we ever thought possible. As founders, we were highly emotionally invested and probably a bit annoying to work with, constantly tweaking ideas. The team at {company_name} handled our manic energy with incredible grace. They acted as a grounding force, helping us prioritize features based on actual user value rather than our whims. Their frontend engineers are top-notch, delivering a complex, map-based search interface that is blisteringly fast. But what we loved most was their absolute dedication to our success. When we had our first major investor demo, the {company_name} team was on standby in a group chat, cheering us on and ready to jump in if anything glitched. They felt like our co-founders. We wouldn't be where we are without their brilliant code.",
    "I have never written a review for a dev agency before, but {company_name} deserves it. We engaged them to build a complex integration between our legacy inventory system and our new WooCommerce storefront. It was a messy, thankless, highly technical project that other agencies had turned down. {company_name} tackled it with enthusiasm. Their developers spent weeks deciphering the spaghetti code of our old system without a single complaint. They communicated their progress clearly, avoiding technical jargon so our executive team could understand the milestones. When they finally turned the integration on, it was seamless. Orders flowed perfectly, inventory synced instantly on the website. It was like magic. But the best part was the attitude of their team. They were always positive, always collaborative, and treated our internal staff with immense respect. {company_name} is a rare gem.",
    "We hired {company_name} to develop a custom SaaS platform for the fitness industry. The project required complex scheduling interfaces and recurring billing integrations. {company_name} executed it flawlessly. However, what makes them special is their commitment to the 'human touch'. During the build, our main point of contact noticed that we were stressing about how to write the user onboarding emails. Even though it wasn't in their scope of work, he connected us with a copywriter he trusted and helped us map out the communication flow. They are constantly looking out for the holistic success of your business, not just the code they are contracted to write. The web platform has been live for six months, it's incredibly stable, and our churn rate is remarkably low because the user experience they designed is so sticky. {company_name} is an incredible partner.",
    "Our experience with {company_name} completely changed my perspective on outsourced web development. We needed a robust, scalable backend for our viral web app. Our internal servers were melting. We called {company_name} in a panic on a Thursday. By Friday, they had a team assembled and were analyzing our architecture. They worked through the weekend alongside our team, migrating our database to a scalable cloud infrastructure and rewriting our most inefficient queries. They saved our app. But what stood out was their bedside manner during the crisis. They were calm, reassuring, and completely devoid of ego. They didn't make our developers feel bad for the initial architecture; they just focused on the solution. Since then, they've been our long-term web development partner. They are incredibly talented, remarkably kind, and utterly dependable.",
    "The bespoke logistics tracking portal {company_name} built for us has literally transformed our customer service. But the reason I recommend them to everyone is their profound empathy for the end-user. Our clients just want to see where their freight is without navigating a maze. {company_name} spent days interviewing our customer service reps before they started designing the interface. They noticed things we hadn'tlike the fact that clients often search by partial PO numbers, so the search bar needed fuzzy logic. The resulting web application is so deeply tailored to the reality of our clients' needs that support calls have dropped by 50%. {company_name} understands that websites are ultimately used by human beings, and they design and build with a level of compassion and foresight that is truly extraordinary.",
    "We came to {company_name} with a highly sensitive project: building a secure, anonymous reporting portal for corporate whistleblowers. The stakes for security and user trust were astronomical. {company_name} handled the project with an incredible level of gravity and professionalism. They brought in external security auditors to verify their own code, proving their commitment to doing it right. But they also focused heavily on the emotional experience of the user. They designed the interface to feel calming, clear, and reassuring, knowing that the people using it would be under immense stress. Their attention to the psychological impact of their frontend design choices was breathtaking. The platform has been universally praised by our compliance team. {company_name} is a team of deeply thoughtful professionals who build websites that matter.",
    "If you want a web agency that will just say 'yes' to every bad idea you have and take your money, don't hire {company_name}. If you want a true strategic partner who will fight for the best version of your site, hire them immediately. We engaged them to build a custom streaming platform. We had a million feature ideas. {company_name} patiently sat us down, helped us strip away the noise, and focused our budget on a rock-solid core web experience. They were firm but always incredibly respectful. They communicated constantly, sending us weekly staging links so we could see the progress in real-time. The final product is elegant, lightning-fast, and exactly what our users actually wanted. Their team is full of brilliant, opinionated, deeply caring professionals who take immense pride in their craft.",
    "Working with {company_name} to revamp our entire digital ecosystem was the highlight of our year. We needed a comprehensive web application to manage our nationwide franchise network. The complexity of managing permissions, localized content, and communication for thousands of franchisees was daunting. {company_name} made it look easy. Their project managers are absolute rockstarskeeping everything on track, within budget, and communicating with total clarity. The developers wrote incredibly clean frontend code that our internal IT team was thrilled to inherit. But the best part was the culture of their team. Every interaction was positive. They celebrated our wins, sent us a beautiful care package on launch day, and always treated our business goals as if they were their own. The portal is a massive success.",
    "We hired {company_name} to develop an AI-driven matching algorithm and the accompanying web platform for our specialized recruitment agency. It was a massive undertaking with a lot of unknowns. {company_name} navigated the ambiguity with total confidence and transparent communication. When the models weren't returning the results we wanted early on in the web interface, they didn't hide the failure; they brought it to us, explained the logic in simple terms, and proposed a UX pivot that ultimately worked perfectly. They treat their clients like intelligent adults. The web platform they delivered is revolutionary for our business, cutting our placement time in half. But what I appreciate most is that even now, a year after launch, I can shoot a quick email to our lead developer with a question and he answers within hours. {company_name} provides world-class web development with heart."
]
],
