    'short' => ['Shopping with {company_name} has been consistently smooth. The website is easy to use and deliveries are always prompt.', 'Great online shopping experience. {company_name} offers quality products with reliable delivery.', 'The customer service at {company_name} is excellent. They\'re responsive and genuinely helpful.', 'Easy to navigate, great products, and fast shipping. {company_name} is my preferred online store.', 'Very satisfied with my purchases from {company_name}. Quality products delivered right to my door.', '{company_name} makes online shopping effortless. The website is well-designed and the checkout is simple.', 'Impressed with the speed and care of delivery from {company_name}. Will definitely shop again.', 'The product range at {company_name} is excellent and the prices are fair. A great online store.', 'Seamless ordering process and quick delivery. {company_name} is an e-commerce site I trust.', 'I\'ve had nothing but positive experiences with {company_name}. Quality products and reliable service.', 'The website at {company_name} is intuitive and the product descriptions are accurate. Very pleased.', 'Fast shipping and great customer support. {company_name} delivers a top-notch online shopping experience.', 'I\'ve ordered multiple times from {company_name} and every experience has been excellent.', '{company_name} offers a fantastic online shopping experience. Easy ordering and prompt delivery every time.', 'Reliable, convenient, and quality-focused. {company_name} has earned my loyalty as an online shopper.'],
    'medium' => ['Shopping through {company_name}\'s website has been a consistently positive experience. The site is easy to navigate, product descriptions are accurate, and the checkout process is straightforward. Deliveries have always arrived on time and the items are well-packaged. Customer service is responsive and helpful whenever I\'ve had a question.',
