    'medium' => ['Shopping at {company_name} is always a pleasant experience. The store is well-organized, the product selection is excellent, and the staff are friendly and helpful. They take the time to assist without being pushy, which makes the whole experience enjoyable. Prices are fair and the quality is consistently good.',
        'I\'ve been a regular customer at {company_name} for a while now and the experience has been consistently positive. The store is clean and well-maintained, the products are varied and of good quality, and the staff are always helpful. It\'s become my preferred shopping destination for quality products.',
