        'Our experience with {company_name} as a wholesale supplier has been very positive. The product quality is consistently good, the pricing is fair, and the delivery is reliable. They understand our business needs and provide a service that supports our operations effectively. Highly recommended.',
        'We\'ve partnered with {company_name} for wholesale trading and the service has been excellent. They provide quality products at competitive bulk prices, and their delivery is always punctual. The team is professional, responsive, and easy to communicate with. A supplier we trust and recommend.',
        '{company_name} has proven to be a reliable wholesale partner for our business. The product quality is consistently high, the pricing is competitive, and the logistics are well-organized. Their team understands our requirements and provides attentive service. We\'re very satisfied with the relationship.',
        'The wholesale service from {company_name} has been a key factor in our supply chain efficiency. They deliver quality products on time, offer competitive pricing, and maintain clear communication. Their team handles our orders with professionalism and care. It\'s been a productive partnership.',
        'I recommend {company_name} for wholesale trading without hesitation. They offer a wide product range, maintain consistent quality, and provide competitive bulk pricing. Their logistics are reliable and their customer service is responsive. They\'re a wholesale supplier that adds real value to our business.'],
    'long' => ['We\'ve been partnering with {company_name} for our wholesale trading needs and the relationship has been consistently productive. They offer an extensive product range with reliable quality and competitive bulk pricing. Orders are processed efficiently, and delivery has been consistently on time  which is critical for our business operations. The team takes the time to understand our requirements and provides tailored support that goes beyond basic transactional service. Any issues are handled promptly and professionally, which has built our trust over time. {company_name} has proven to be a dependable wholesale partner that we rely on for the smooth operation of our business.',
