        'I\'ve been a loyal customer at {company_name} for some time and the service has been consistently excellent. They handle everything from routine maintenance to complex repairs with skill and honesty. The turnaround time is reasonable and the pricing is always upfront. It\'s a shop I trust with my vehicles.',
        'The mechanics at {company_name} are skilled, honest, and professional. They\'ve handled multiple vehicles for our family and the work has always been top-notch. They explain the issues clearly, don\'t recommend unnecessary work, and complete everything on schedule. A great automobile service provider.',
        'I was impressed by how {company_name} handled a complex repair on my vehicle. They diagnosed the issue accurately, explained the repair process clearly, and completed the work to a high standard. The pricing was fair and the turnaround was faster than expected. Highly recommend their services.',
        'Reliable, honest, and skilled  that\'s what {company_name} delivers. They\'ve been looking after my vehicle for a while and the service has been consistently excellent. The mechanics take the time to explain what\'s needed and the work is always done right. My trusted auto service provider.',
        'The service at {company_name} is first-rate. They\'re transparent about costs, efficient in their work, and thorough in their diagnostics. My vehicle has been in their hands multiple times and each visit has been a positive experience. They\'re my go-to for any automobile service need.',
        'I trust {company_name} completely with my vehicle. The mechanics are experienced and straightforward, the pricing is fair, and the work quality is consistently high. They communicate clearly throughout the process and complete the work on time. It\'s the kind of auto shop that earns your loyalty.',
        'What sets {company_name} apart is their combination of technical skill and honest communication. They diagnose issues accurately, explain the work needed in plain language, and complete repairs to a high standard. The pricing is always fair and reasonable. I\'ve recommended them to several friends who\'ve had equally positive experiences.',
        'My car has been serviced by {company_name} several times and each visit has been excellent. The mechanics are skilled, the work is thorough, and the pricing is transparent. They treat every vehicle with care and provide clear updates throughout the service. A highly recommended auto shop.',
        'The automobile service from {company_name} has been consistently outstanding. They handle routine maintenance and complex repairs with equal skill and professionalism. The team is honest, efficient, and communicative. My vehicle always comes back running perfectly. It\'s a shop that has earned my trust and loyalty.'],
    'long' => ['I\'ve been taking my vehicles to {company_name} for several years and the service has been consistently excellent. The mechanics are skilled, honest, and genuinely interested in doing the job right. They take the time to diagnose issues thoroughly, explain what needs to be done in plain language, and complete the work to a high standard. The pricing is always fair and transparent  no hidden charges or unnecessary upselling. They handle everything from routine maintenance to complex repairs with the same level of professionalism. The turnaround time is reasonable and they keep you informed throughout the process. {company_name} has earned my complete trust as my go-to automobile service provider.',
        'I was looking for a mechanic I could trust and {company_name} has proven to be exactly that. From my first visit, the team was professional, transparent, and skilled. They diagnosed an issue that another shop had missed, explained the problem clearly, and completed the repair to an excellent standard. Since then, they\'ve handled all my vehicle\'s maintenance and any unexpected repairs with consistent quality and honesty. The pricing is always fair, the communication is clear, and they complete the work on schedule. {company_name} is an automobile service provider that genuinely cares about doing things right.',
        'The service I\'ve received from {company_name} has been outstanding on every occasion. Their mechanics are experienced and thorough, taking the time to properly diagnose issues rather than guessing. They explain the work needed clearly, provide honest recommendations, and complete repairs to a high standard. The pricing is transparent and competitive, and the turnaround time is reasonable. What I appreciate most is their honesty  they don\'t recommend work that isn\'t necessary, which builds real trust. My vehicle has been in their hands for both routine servicing and unexpected repairs, and the quality has been consistently excellent. {company_name} is my trusted automotive partner.',
        'I brought my car to {company_name} for a complex issue that had been causing me problems, and they handled it with impressive skill and professionalism. The diagnostic process was thorough, the explanation was clear, and the repair was executed to a high standard. They kept me informed throughout and completed the work within the estimated timeframe. The pricing was fair for the quality of work delivered. Since that initial visit, they\'ve handled all my car\'s servicing needs with the same level of care and expertise. {company_name} has become the auto shop I recommend to everyone I know.',
        'Working with {company_name} for my vehicle\'s maintenance and repairs has been a thoroughly positive experience. Their team is knowledgeable, honest, and professional  a combination that\'s hard to find in auto service. They take the time to explain issues clearly, recommend only what\'s necessary, and complete work to an excellent standard. The pricing is always upfront and reasonable, and the turnaround time is reasonable. I\'ve trusted them with multiple vehicles over the years and the quality of service has remained consistently high. {company_name} is an automobile service provider that I recommend with complete confidence.',
        'The mechanics at {company_name} are among the most skilled and honest I\'ve encountered. They\'ve handled everything from oil changes and brake work to more complex engine repairs for my vehicles, and the quality has been excellent every time. They explain the work clearly before beginning, provide honest assessments, and don\'t recommend unnecessary repairs. The pricing is fair and transparent, and they complete the work efficiently. I\'ve recommended {company_name} to family and friends, and every one of them has had a similarly positive experience. They\'re my trusted automotive service provider.',
        'I switched to {company_name} after a bad experience at another auto shop and the difference has been remarkable. The team is professional, honest, and genuinely skilled. They took the time to properly diagnose my vehicle\'s issue, explained the problem in detail, and completed the repair to a high standard. The pricing was fair and they finished within the estimated timeframe. Since then, they\'ve handled all my car\'s maintenance needs with consistent quality. {company_name} has restored my confidence in auto service and has become my permanent go-to shop.',
        'My experience with {company_name} has been consistently excellent over many visits. They handle routine servicing and unexpected repairs with the same level of professionalism and care. The mechanics are skilled and take the time to diagnose issues properly rather than taking shortcuts. They explain the work needed in clear, honest terms and complete everything to a high standard. The pricing is always fair and upfront, which I really appreciate. {company_name} is an automobile service shop that values its customers and earns their loyalty through honest, quality work.',
        'I\'ve been a customer of {company_name} for quite some time and their automobile service has been outstanding every visit. Their mechanics are experienced, professional, and genuinely care about doing the job right. They diagnose issues thoroughly, communicate clearly, and complete repairs to an excellent standard. The pricing is transparent and competitive, and they always provide a reasonable timeframe for the work. What I value most is their honesty  they treat you like a valued customer, not a transaction. {company_name} is a trusted auto service provider that I recommend without reservation.',
        'The team at {company_name} has been looking after my vehicles for years and the quality of service has remained consistently high. They handle everything from basic maintenance to complex repairs with skill and professionalism. The diagnostics are thorough, the explanations are clear, and the work is done right the first time. The pricing is fair, the turnaround is reasonable, and the communication is excellent throughout. I\'ve never had a reason to look elsewhere for auto service. {company_name} is a shop that genuinely cares about its customers and their vehicles.',
        'I was referred to {company_name} by a colleague and I\'m glad I made the switch. The mechanics are skilled, honest, and professional  they explain the issues clearly and only recommend work that\'s genuinely needed. The quality of repairs has been excellent, and my vehicle has been running better than ever. The pricing is fair and transparent, and the service is efficient. I\'ve trusted them with both routine maintenance and unexpected repairs, and they\'ve handled everything with the same level of care. {company_name} is an automobile service provider I recommend enthusiastically.',
        'My experience with {company_name} for automobile service has been nothing short of excellent. Their team is knowledgeable, thorough, and genuinely committed to doing quality work. They take the time to properly diagnose issues, explain the necessary repairs, and complete the work to a high standard. The pricing is always fair and communicated upfront. What stands out is their honesty and integrity  they don\'t recommend unnecessary work and they treat every customer with respect. I\'ve relied on them for multiple vehicles and the quality of service has been consistently outstanding. {company_name} is my trusted auto shop.',
        'I\'ve been bringing my vehicles to {company_name} for a while now and wouldn\'t consider going anywhere else. The mechanics are skilled, the service is professional, and the pricing is transparent. They explain every repair in detail before starting work, which I really appreciate. The turnaround time is always reasonable and my car comes back running perfectly. What sets them apart is their honesty  they\'ve never recommended work that wasn\'t genuinely needed. {company_name} has earned my loyalty through consistently excellent and trustworthy service.',
        'The quality of service at {company_name} is exceptional. They\'ve handled everything from basic oil changes to significant engine repairs for my vehicles, and the work has been outstanding every time. The mechanics are experienced, the diagnostics are thorough, and the explanations are clear. Pricing is fair and transparent, and they always complete the work within the estimated timeframe. I trust {company_name} completely with my vehicles and recommend them without hesitation to anyone looking for honest, skilled automobile service.',
        'I can\'t say enough good things about {company_name}. Their mechanics are skilled, honest, and genuinely passionate about their work. They\'ve been maintaining my vehicles for years and the quality has been consistently excellent. Every visit includes a thorough inspection, clear communication about what\'s needed, and fair pricing. They treat every vehicle with the same level of care and professionalism. {company_name} is the kind of auto shop that earns your complete trust, and I wouldn\'t hesitate to recommend them to anyone.']
],
    'Hotel & Hospitality' => [
    'short' => ['My stay at {company_name} was wonderful. Comfortable rooms, attentive staff, and a great overall experience.', 'Excellent hospitality. {company_name} made us feel welcome from the moment we arrived.', 'Beautiful hotel with great amenities. {company_name} exceeded our expectations in every way.', 'The service at {company_name} was outstanding. Staff were warm, professional, and always helpful.', 'A fantastic hotel experience. {company_name} has everything you need for a comfortable stay.', 'Very impressed with {company_name}. The rooms were spotless and the staff were exceptional.', 'We loved our stay at {company_name}. The attention to detail and quality of service is remarkable.', 'Top-notch hospitality at {company_name}. The facilities are excellent and the staff go above and beyond.', '{company_name} provided a wonderful stay. Clean, comfortable, and the staff were genuinely welcoming.', 'Outstanding hotel experience. {company_name} combines comfort, quality, and exceptional service.', 'Our stay at {company_name} was perfect. The rooms were beautiful and the service was impeccable.', 'Highly recommend {company_name} for a comfortable and enjoyable stay. The staff really care.', 'The hospitality at {company_name} was exceptional. We felt truly valued as guests.', 'A lovely hotel with great facilities. {company_name} made our stay memorable and enjoyable.', 'Five-star experience at {company_name}. The comfort, cleanliness, and service are all top-notch.'],
    'medium' => ['Our stay at {company_name} was thoroughly enjoyable. The rooms were comfortable and well-maintained, the staff were warm and attentive, and every aspect of the experience felt thoughtfully considered. From check-in to check-out, everything ran smoothly. It\'s the kind of hospitality that makes you want to return.',
