        '{company_name} provided a wonderful stay experience. The hotel is beautifully maintained, the rooms are spacious and comfortable, and the staff go above and beyond to ensure your comfort. The attention to detail in service was impressive. We\'ll definitely be returning for future visits.',
        'I was impressed by the quality of service at {company_name}. Every staff member was professional, courteous, and genuinely interested in making our stay enjoyable. The room was immaculate and well-equipped, and the hotel facilities were excellent. It\'s clear they take pride in providing outstanding hospitality.',
        'Our experience at {company_name} was outstanding. The hotel offers a perfect balance of comfort and luxury. The rooms are beautifully designed and maintained, the dining was excellent, and the staff were attentive without being overbearing. It\'s the kind of place that makes a trip truly special.',
        'Staying at {company_name} was a highlight of our trip. The room was spacious, comfortable, and impeccably clean. The staff were warm and accommodating, always available when needed but never intrusive. The hotel amenities were excellent and the overall atmosphere was relaxing and inviting. We couldn\'t have asked for more.',
        'The service at {company_name} was first-rate. From the welcoming check-in to the comfortable rooms to the helpful concierge, every aspect was handled with professionalism and care. The hotel is beautifully maintained and the attention to guest comfort is evident throughout. A truly excellent hospitality experience.',
        'We had a wonderful stay at {company_name}. The room was comfortable and well-appointed, with everything we needed for a relaxing visit. The staff were friendly and professional, always ready to help with a smile. The hotel\'s attention to detail in service and maintenance made our stay genuinely enjoyable. Highly recommend.',
        '{company_name} exceeded our expectations in every way. The hotel is beautifully designed, the rooms are comfortable and clean, and the staff provide a level of service that feels genuinely personal. Whether it\'s the quality of the rooms, the attentiveness of the staff, or the overall atmosphere, everything was excellent.',
        'My stay at {company_name} was seamless and enjoyable. The room was comfortable and well-maintained, the hotel facilities were top-notch, and the staff were professional and welcoming. They accommodated our requests with grace and ensured we had everything we needed. It\'s a hotel I\'d return to without hesitation.',
        'The hospitality at {company_name} was exceptional. The staff made us feel valued from the moment we arrived, and the quality of the rooms and amenities matched their outstanding service. The hotel was spotlessly clean and beautifully maintained. It\'s a place that understands what true hospitality means. We\'ll definitely be back.',
        'I chose {company_name} for our vacation and couldn\'t be happier with the decision. The hotel was beautiful, the rooms were comfortable and well-equipped, and the staff were genuinely warm and helpful. The attention to detail in every aspect of the stay was impressive. A truly memorable hospitality experience.',
        'Our experience at {company_name} was outstanding from start to finish. The check-in was smooth, the room was immaculate, and the service was consistently excellent throughout our stay. The hotel staff went above and beyond to ensure our comfort. It\'s the kind of hospitality that earns your loyalty.',
        '{company_name} delivered an exceptional hotel experience. The rooms were beautifully maintained, the facilities were excellent, and the staff were professional and attentive. Every detail was thoughtfully managed to ensure guest satisfaction. It\'s a hotel that sets a high standard in hospitality.',
        'A wonderful stay at {company_name}. The room was spacious, clean, and comfortable. The staff were friendly and professional, providing a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The hotel\'s commitment to quality service and guest satisfaction was evident in every interaction. Highly recommend for anyone seeking excellent hospitality.'],
    'long' => ['Our stay at {company_name} was thoroughly enjoyable from start to finish. The hotel is beautifully maintained with a welcoming atmosphere that immediately puts you at ease. Our room was spacious, comfortable, and impeccably clean, with thoughtful touches that made the stay feel special. The staff were warm, professional, and genuinely invested in making our experience excellent. Whether it was the attentive check-in, the helpful concierge, or the quality of the dining, every aspect was handled with care. The hotel facilities were top-notch and the overall experience was one of complete satisfaction. {company_name} has set a high standard in hospitality and we look forward to returning.',
