        '{company_name} handled a plumbing emergency for us with impressive speed and professionalism. They responded to our call quickly, arrived prepared, and resolved the issue thoroughly. Their technician was knowledgeable and explained what had caused the problem. The repair has held perfectly and we feel much more confident about our plumbing now.',
        'The electrical work completed by {company_name} was excellent. Their electrician was skilled, thorough, and safety-conscious throughout the project. They completed the work to a high standard and left our property clean and tidy. Their pricing was fair and they delivered exactly what they promised. We would not hesitate to use them again.',
        'We have used {company_name} for several plumbing and electrical projects and they consistently deliver quality work. Their team is professional, reliable, and skilled in their trade. They communicate clearly about what work is needed and complete it to a high standard. Their pricing is fair and transparent. We highly recommend their services.',
        'The plumbing repair done by {company_name} was handled professionally from start to finish. Their plumber arrived on time, diagnosed the problem accurately, and explained the repair process clearly. The work was completed efficiently with quality materials, and everything has been working perfectly since. We are very satisfied with their service.',
        '{company_name} provided excellent electrical services for our renovation project. Their electrician was knowledgeable, professional, and worked to a high standard throughout. They coordinated well with other trades on site and completed their work on schedule. The quality of their installation is excellent and we are very happy with the results.',
        'Professional plumbing service from {company_name}. Their plumber was experienced, efficient, and completed the repair to a high standard. They were transparent about pricing and the work was done cleanly. We have used them several times now and they consistently deliver excellent work. Highly recommended for any plumbing needs.',
        'We called {company_name} for an electrical issue and they responded promptly. Their electrician was skilled and professional, diagnosing the problem quickly and implementing a safe, effective solution. The work was completed to a high standard and everything has been functioning perfectly since. Reliable and excellent quality service.',
        'The plumbing work done by {company_name} was outstanding. Their team was professional, skilled, and completed the project on time. They used quality materials and their workmanship is excellent. They were also transparent about costs and communicated well throughout the project. We would definitely use their services again.',
        '{company_name} handled our electrical installation with great expertise. Their electrician was thorough, safety-conscious, and completed the work to an excellent standard. They were professional in their approach and left the work area clean. Their pricing was competitive and fair. We are very satisfied with the quality of their work.',
        'Reliable and skilled -- that is what we have found with {company_name}. They have handled several plumbing and electrical jobs for us and consistently deliver quality work. Their team is professional, punctual, and completes work to a high standard. We trust them completely and recommend them without hesitation.'],
    'long' => ['We engaged {company_name} for a significant plumbing and electrical renovation project and they exceeded our expectations. Their team brought expertise and professionalism to every aspect of the work. They started with a thorough assessment of our existing systems, identified what needed to be updated, and developed a comprehensive plan. The plumbing work was carried out with skill and attention to detail, using quality materials that will last. The electrical work was equally impressive -- their electrician was knowledgeable, safety-conscious, and installed everything to current standards. They worked around our schedule to minimize disruption and kept us informed throughout the project. The finished work is excellent, with everything functioning perfectly. Their pricing was fair and transparent, with no unexpected costs. {company_name} has proven to be a reliable, skilled trades partner that we would recommend without hesitation for any plumbing or electrical work.',
        'The plumbing repair completed by {company_name} was handled with impressive professionalism. We had a complex issue that other plumbers had struggled to resolve, but their team diagnosed it accurately and implemented an effective solution. Their plumber was experienced, thorough, and clearly understood the problem. They used quality materials and completed the work to a high standard. They also took the time to explain what had caused the issue and how to prevent it in the future. The repair has held perfectly and we have had no further problems. Their pricing was fair and their communication throughout was excellent. {company_name} has earned our complete trust for any plumbing needs.',
