    'Renewable Energy' => [
    'short' => ['{company_name} installed our renewable energy system with expertise and professionalism. The results have been outstanding.', 'Excellent renewable energy services from {company_name}. Their installation was efficient and well-executed.', 'Very satisfied with {company_name}\'s renewable energy solutions. Professional installation and great support.', 'Outstanding work from {company_name}. Our renewable energy system is performing beyond our expectations.', 'Professional and knowledgeable -- {company_name} delivered an excellent renewable energy installation.', 'Great experience with {company_name}. Their renewable energy expertise made our transition smooth.', 'Reliable and skilled -- {company_name} handles renewable energy installations with impressive expertise.', 'The team at {company_name} is knowledgeable, professional, and delivered excellent renewable energy results.', '{company_name} provides outstanding renewable energy services. Efficient installation and reliable performance.', 'Impressed by {company_name}\'s renewable energy expertise. Professional installation and excellent results.', 'We trust {company_name} for renewable energy solutions. Their work has been outstanding and efficient.', 'Professional renewable energy installation from {company_name}. Quality work and great performance.', 'Choosing {company_name} for renewable energy was the best decision. Excellent results and great support.', 'The renewable energy system installed by {company_name} is performing excellently. Professional and reliable.', 'Highly recommend {company_name} for renewable energy. Expert installation and outstanding results.'],
    'medium' => ['We engaged {company_name} for our renewable energy installation and the whole experience was smooth and professional. Their team was knowledgeable, worked efficiently, and ensured everything was set up correctly. They were happy to answer all our questions and made sure we understood how the system works. We are very happy with the outcome.',
        '{company_name} provided excellent renewable energy services for our property. Their team assessed our needs thoroughly, designed an appropriate system, and installed it with impressive efficiency. The system is performing well and we are already seeing benefits. Their knowledge and professionalism made the process straightforward and stress-free.',
        'The renewable energy installation by {company_name} was outstanding. Their team was professional, knowledgeable, and worked with impressive efficiency. They designed a system that perfectly suits our needs and installed it to a high standard. Their ongoing support and guidance have been valuable. We recommend their services without hesitation.',
        'Working with {company_name} on our renewable energy project was a positive experience from start to finish. Their team was knowledgeable, professional, and responsive to our questions. They designed and installed a system that meets our energy needs while maximizing efficiency. Their expertise and attention to detail were evident throughout the project.',
        '{company_name} installed a renewable energy system for us and the results have been excellent. Their team was professional, efficient, and clearly experienced in this field. They designed a system tailored to our requirements and installed it to a high standard. Their ongoing support has been valuable and we are very satisfied with the outcome.',
        'The renewable energy services from {company_name} were outstanding. Their team assessed our property, designed an efficient system, and installed it with professionalism and care. They were knowledgeable about the technology and answered all our questions thoroughly. The system is performing well and we are very happy with the results.',
        'We relied on {company_name} for our renewable energy needs and they delivered excellent results. Their team was professional, knowledgeable, and efficient throughout the installation process. They designed a system that suits our property and energy requirements perfectly. Their ongoing support and guidance have been valuable. We recommend their services.',
        '{company_name} provided professional renewable energy installation that exceeded our expectations. Their team was knowledgeable, efficient, and clearly experienced. They designed and installed a system that is performing excellently and meeting our energy needs. Their ongoing support has been helpful and their commitment to customer satisfaction is evident.',
        'The renewable energy project managed by {company_name} was completed to an excellent standard. Their team was professional, knowledgeable, and worked efficiently throughout the installation. They designed a system that maximizes energy production for our property and installed it with care and precision. Their ongoing support has been valuable.',
        'Excellent renewable energy services from {company_name}. Their team was professional, knowledgeable, and installed our system with impressive efficiency. The system is performing well and we are already seeing benefits. Their ongoing support and guidance have been helpful. We recommend {company_name} for renewable energy solutions.',
        'We engaged {company_name} for renewable energy installation and they delivered outstanding results. Their team was professional, efficient, and knowledgeable about the technology. They designed a system that suits our needs perfectly and installed it to a high standard. Their ongoing support has been valuable and we are very satisfied with the outcome.',
        '{company_name} handled our renewable energy installation with expertise and professionalism. Their team was knowledgeable, efficient, and clearly experienced in this field. They designed and installed a system that meets our energy requirements while maximizing efficiency. Their ongoing support has been helpful. We recommend their services to others.',
        'The renewable energy system installed by {company_name} is performing excellently. Their team was professional, knowledgeable, and worked with impressive efficiency. They designed a system tailored to our property and installed it to a high standard. Their ongoing support and customer service have been outstanding. Very satisfied with the results.',
        'Professional renewable energy services from {company_name}. Their team was knowledgeable, efficient, and installed our system with great care. The system is meeting our energy needs and performing well. Their ongoing support has been valuable and their commitment to customer satisfaction is evident. We recommend them highly.',
        'Choosing {company_name} for our renewable energy installation was an excellent decision. Their team was professional, knowledgeable, and worked efficiently throughout the project. They designed a system that suits our property perfectly and installed it to a high standard. The results have been outstanding and their ongoing support is appreciated.'],
    'long' => ['We engaged {company_name} to install a renewable energy system for our property and the experience was excellent from start to finish. Their team conducted a thorough assessment of our energy needs, property characteristics, and goals before designing a system that perfectly suited our requirements. Their installation was carried out with impressive professionalism and efficiency, with every component installed to a high standard. They were knowledgeable about the technology and took time to explain how the system works and how to get the best performance from it. The system is performing well and we are already seeing benefits in terms of energy production and cost savings. Their ongoing support and guidance have been valuable. {company_name} has proven to be a renewable energy partner that delivers excellent results, and we recommend them without hesitation to anyone considering renewable energy solutions.',
        'The renewable energy installation completed by {company_name} has been outstanding. Their team demonstrated deep expertise in renewable energy technology, conducting a thorough assessment of our property and energy needs before designing an optimal system. Their installation was carried out with impressive skill and efficiency, with attention to detail evident throughout. They were knowledgeable about every aspect of the system and took time to ensure we understood how it works and how to maintain it. The system is performing excellently and we are very happy with the results. Their ongoing support has been equally impressive, with responsive assistance whenever we have questions. {company_name} has proven to be a renewable energy provider that combines technical expertise with genuine customer care. We recommend them enthusiastically.',
        'Working with {company_name} on our renewable energy project has been a very positive experience. Their team brought comprehensive expertise to the assessment, design, and installation phases. They assessed our property thoroughly, designed a system that maximizes energy production for our situation, and installed it with professionalism and care. Their knowledge of renewable energy technology is impressive and they were able to answer all our questions thoroughly. The system is performing well and we are seeing the expected benefits. Their ongoing support and maintenance guidance have been valuable. {company_name} has demonstrated that they are true experts in renewable energy, combining technical skill with genuine customer care. We recommend them to anyone considering renewable energy solutions.',
        '{company_name} installed a renewable energy system for us and the results have exceeded our expectations. Their team was professional, knowledgeable, and efficient throughout the entire project. They started with a detailed assessment of our property and energy requirements, then designed a system that was optimized for our situation. The installation was carried out with impressive skill and attention to detail. They took time to explain how the system works and provided helpful guidance on maintenance and optimization. The system is performing excellently and we are very satisfied with the energy production and efficiency. Their ongoing support has been responsive and valuable. {company_name} has proven to be a renewable energy partner that delivers exceptional results, and we recommend them highly.',
